<title>UK: DSL Bank sets 300 mln mark Aug 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank sets 300 mln mark Aug 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50 PCT  MATURITY    03.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.88    PAY DATE   *28.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75 PCT  REOFFER    99.955    SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.225 PCT SELL CONC   1.525 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
